# Code owners for protected paths (agent-workflow.md §4).
# With branch protection's "Require review from Code Owners" turned on, a PR that
# touches any path below cannot merge without an approving review from an owner.
# PR authors cannot approve their own PRs, so a PR opened by one owner needs the other.

# Ownership rules
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @entidex @dea-mon
/.github/workflows/                 @entidex @dea-mon
/.github/scripts/                   @entidex @dea-mon
/CLAUDE.md                          @entidex @dea-mon
/agent-workflow.md                  @entidex @dea-mon
/.claude/                           @entidex @dea-mon

# Release config and version files
/mcp-registry/                      @entidex @dea-mon
/packages/*/package.json            @entidex @dea-mon

# Paths named in §4 that don't exist yet, owned in advance
/deploy/                            @entidex @dea-mon
/infra/                             @entidex @dea-mon
/migrations/                        @entidex @dea-mon
/schema/                            @entidex @dea-mon
Dockerfile*                         @entidex @dea-mon
Makefile                            @entidex @dea-mon
